        en: "Tunis-Carthage airport is 20 km from the Gammarth hotels, and the TGM train links La Marsa, Sidi Bou Said, Carthage, La Goulette and Tunis. Express bus lines connect the area with Tunis. To visit Carthage you can agree a fare with a taxi to tour the various sites spread through the modern town.",
