        en: "“Don't tan foolishly” was, in the 1970s, the memorable slogan of the Tabarka music festival, its point being that Tabarka offers more than a beach holiday. Its relief and nature make it resemble Corsica more than any other part of Tunisia. Tabarka is a destination for discovery with a long diving tradition and astonishing dive sites, and it offers many boat trips to the nearby bays or to the island of La Galite. Add to that a golf course and centres for thalassotherapy and mineral-water treatment (at Hammam Bourguiba). In summer Tabarka comes alive with many events under the banner of jazz and world music, in a north-west Tunisia of dense forest and untouched nature.",
