        en: "Tabarka is a resort with about ten hotels and holiday complexes along the beach. You can choose a hotel at the edge of the forest or a charming small hotel in the town centre. Around Aïn Draham there are many comfortable hotels, hunters' lodges with rustic decor, high-quality accommodation in the heart of nature, or a large mineral-water treatment hotel in the middle of the forest.",
