        en: "In the souk shops buy a beautiful Kairouan carpet, a woven esparto basket, silver jewellery or a brass tray engraved with your name. Stock up on Tunisian products such as olive oil, harissa (hot pepper paste) and sweets. And make a date with Moknine, the pottery village 20 km away: large earthenware jars are its speciality, but it also makes tableware and ceramics in Tunisian colours.",
